    "title": "Urgent Opening Hotel Manager at Cox & Kings India International Enterprises",
    "description": "If you're a passionate Hotel Manager with drive and ambition, Cox & Kings India International Enterprises in Raipur is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Cox & Kings India International Enterprises:\nCox & Kings India International Enterprises is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n• Coordinate housekeeping and maintenance for room readiness\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n• Manage procurement of hotel supplies and control operating costs\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in MICE\n• Proficiency in Travel Management\n• Proficiency in Yield Management\n• Proficiency in Event Management\n• Proficiency in F&B Service\n• Proficiency in GDS Systems\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Raipur, Chhattisgarh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Cox & Kings India International Enterprises!",
